# bench/ is investigation scaffolding: round-specific probes, one-off harnesses
# and their recorded output. Kept locally because several of them are the only
# record of how a given number was produced, but not shipped -- nothing in the
# encoder, the gates or the README depends on it.
/bench/

# Session instructions for AI tooling. Kept locally, not shipped: it names
